    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Nalla Toilettage, at 18 avenue Paul Bourget in Hyères, is run by Adelina, a state-certified groomer since 1999. The salon takes dogs of all breeds: bath with a shampoo suited to the coat, careful drying, brushing and detangling, then a cut and finish. An on-site shop sells dog clothing and accessories.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon works by appointment only, booked by phone: Monday, Tuesday, Thursday and Friday 9am-5pm, Saturday 9am-1pm. Prices are not published on the salon's website, so ask when you book.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: everything is by appointment, so call a few days ahead.</div>

